suppporting A2DP (Jabra BT620s) and every thing works great when I use
only one from this two devices. When I try to run them together sounds
start copping and mouse doesn't move smoothly. Probably they are
fighting for full speed connection with adapter, but in my laptop I
have bt2.0 + EDR and mouse and headset have only 1.2. When I use
special adapter (Jabra BT120s) I can use together mouse and headset,
but this don't solves my problem, because I need to carry it every
where I am. How do you thing, maybe we need only a few changes inside
bluez to solve this problem?

